       "y": 520
      },
      "label": "THE RAFFLE"
     }
    }
   ]
  },
  {
   "vo": "The father, Mounir, is from Morocco. The mother, Sheila, from Equatorial Guinea. Their son is only weeks old. His name is Lamine.",
