      "value": 17,
      "label": "YEARS FORGOTTEN"
     }
    }
   ]
  },
  {
   "vo": "In those seventeen years, Messi becomes the greatest player of his generation. Eight Ballon d'Or awards. And in Qatar, in twenty twenty-two, the World Cup he had chased all his life.",
   "shots": [
    {
     "clip": "stadium-drone-after",
     "tag": "8 BALLON D'OR"
    },
    {
     "clip": "fans-arg-pixar-joy"
    },
    {
     "clip": "trophy-pedestal",
     "tag": "QATAR 2022"
    }
   ]
  },
  {
   "vo": "And every time he scores, he points to the sky. For his grandmother Celia, the woman who first walked him to football, in Rosario.",
   "shots": [
    {
     "clip": "rosario-grandmother",
     "tag": "ROSARIO"
    },
    {
     "clip": "phone-lights-crowd"
    }
   ]
  },
  {
   "vo": "Chapter three. The boy from three-zero-four.",
   "shots": [
    {
     "clip": "fans-spain-pixar-flags",
     "over": {
      "type": "chapter",
      "title": "The Boy From 304"
     }
    }
   ]
  },
  {
   "vo": "Meanwhile, the baby from the bathtub grows up in Rocafonda, the ball always at his feet. At six, Barcelona bring him into La Masia. The same academy that made Messi.",
   "shots": [
    {
     "clip": "spain-feet-pixar",
     "tag": "ROCAFONDA"
    },
    {
     "scene": {
      "type": "jersey",
      "number": "",
      "label": "LA MASIA · AGE 6"
     }
    }
   ]
  },
  {
   "vo": "April twenty twenty-three. At fifteen years and two hundred and ninety days old, he makes his first-team debut.",
   "shots": [
    {
     "clip": "boot-touchline",
     "over": {
      "type": "stat",
      "value": 15,
      "label": "YEARS OLD",
      "sub": "FIRST-TEAM DEBUT"
     }
    }
   ]
  },
  {
   "vo": "And when Yamal scores, he makes a sign with his fingers. Three. Zero. Four. The last digits of Rocafonda's postcode. Like Messi pointing to the sky, he points back to where it all began.",
   "shots": [
    {
     "clip": "yamal-pixar-portrait",
     "offset": 1.8,
